  {"id":7942,"hitokoto":"I have only made this letter rather long because I have not had time to make it shorter.","type":"k","from":"信件","from_who":"Blaise Pascal","length":88},
  {"id":8016,"hitokoto":"资本来到世间，从头到脚每个毛孔都滴着血和肮脏的东西。","type":"k","from":"资本论","from_who":"卡尔·海因里希·马克思","length":26},
